From: sjcsf <346224915+llsf2020@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 07/12] FreeChat: strict mode and memory-only logs

Strict mode (per device, opt-in): the session and crypto store stay in memory,
closing the page signs out on the server and wipes localStorage, and hiding the
page for the chosen time signs out. Rageshake logs are no longer persisted.
